话表示要和赵敏分手。心急如焚的赵敏想要解释，但手机突然失去信号，随后赵敏惊恐地发现，地铁驶入了一条完全陌生的路线。面对错乱的时间、暴毙的乘客、诡异的站台，你敢下车吗？","series_id":"7550994162204544024","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233050CB3D69694583ACA6E709\",\"rank\":\"5\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7550994162204544024\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.04962879419326782,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1654647588729858,\\\"finish\\\":0.020023444667458534,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7563153505325317,\\\"collect\\\":0.046724967658519745,\\\"like\\\":0.058345843106508255,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.12913784384727478}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7550994162204544024","play_cnt":324286,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"琅琊阁剧场","sub_title":"悬疑·悬疑推理","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":30,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5004,\"name\":\"悬疑\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5004&categoryName=悬疑&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5055,\"name\":\"悬疑推理\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5055&categoryName=悬疑推理&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5143,\"name\":\"AI觉醒\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5143&categoryName=AI觉醒&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5180,\"name\":\"反转\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5180&categoryName=反转&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5370,\"name\":\"推理解谜\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5370&categoryName=推理解谜&g